  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Explore single cells on a 2-D embedding, colour them by metadata or gene expression, select groups by category, histogram range or expression, compare two groups with on-demand differential expression, and save cell-type labels and gene sets back to CSV. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
